      "value": "Im sure there will be a way to legally show the record was changed. I think its more of if its reported the user is underage and they falsified the record then would it have actions taken on.\n\nIn the examples your mentioning, theres legal steps and that would be handled im sure.\n\nIn cases where people falsify information on purpose for the sake of bypassing the system, THAT is where they'd be breaking TOS and some federal laws in some places.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
